/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Security remediation runbook - source and rendered page alike.
#
# Deliberately kept in the working tree and out of git: this repository is
# public (umr-amap/cafriplotsR), and the runbook names the host, the port,
# the PostgreSQL version, the grants still open and the file:line where the
# credential was hardcoded. Committing it would publish a live vulnerability
# to the very repository the vulnerability is about.
#
# Do not commit, do not push, do not remove this rule once the remediation is
# closed without first checking what the file still discloses.
PLAN_SECURITY_REMEDIATION.*
